{"kind":"propose","text":"Adopt the independently reviewed attention-runtime Draft2 as the private runtime planning handoff for existing C3/C1/wake work, not as a public protocol amendment or implementation approval. Exact primaryc85631b5, attachment7f3cb69d,14,606bytes SHA2566b0cb9cd9f8079ed0ff21d5b3d13bb3838bfb2c5678f8a930cbf7f40d068ca5d, approved by78be0cd1 and review completion ratified3057e53a. C3 must durably retain/dispose input before advancing its own cursor, order overlapping ingestion, recover stable conversation identities with author-as-data provenance, and perform bounded resumable fresh/current-work catch-up for changed principals or filters without regressing ordinary progress or resubmitting completed identities. Lost wakes need the named active scheduling path; delayed dispatch checks current obligations/authority/lease/epoch. Existing C1 pause/device/revocation rules and separation of attention, act retry, command effects and authoritative outcomes remain. Public wake cursor meaning, because eligibility and any added read fields still need the named owners' contract review; exact identity encoding and host mechanism remain implementation choices. No new implementation lane, old wake-note approval, frozen005/006 rewrite or additional Jam gate. Highest-priority test reduction; then acts and concrete Jam blockers; builder-owned actual self-host readiness, then Jam/full manual in parallel.","body":{"scope":"Planning handoff for existing C3/C1/wake work; public schemas and runtime evidence remain unadopted"}}